WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.340
The query changed. Who chose the next action?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:01:11.471
Fixed, adaptive and agentic name different controls

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:42.560
The brief specifies the task; the harness bounds the actions

00:01:42.560 --> 00:02:19.005
A long report does not establish agency

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:57.505
Control does not replace the retriever’s scoring rule

00:02:57.505 --> 00:03:33.828
Assess the mode, not the brand

00:03:33.828 --> 00:04:07.592
A marketing label and a documented mechanism can differ

00:04:07.592 --> 00:04:41.433
Choose control for the procedure the task requires
